  "configuration_id": "config_025",
  "reason": "The strongest evidence across 9 experiments clearly identifies scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + multiprofile + transformer + weighted (config_021, acc=0.7250) as the best configuration. The only untested variable within this top-performing family is the image encoder: all scvi_n200 multiprofile results used imagenet_vit_l, while resnet50 has only been tested with the much weaker scgpt encoder. Config_025 (scvi_n200 + resnet50 + multiprofile + transformer + weighted) directly tests whether swapping the image encoder to resnet50 could improve upon 0.7250 or confirm imagenet_vit_l as optimal. As the final experiment, this is the highest-value exploitation step: it keeps every other hyperparameter at its empirically best setting and probes the one remaining axis of variation, giving the clearest signal about whether the current best is truly at a local optimum or whether a different backbone could push accuracy higher."
}

